unch step exports the lane switch, the restore action excludes q-compiled/trusted-root from checkout materialization, and the W2 checkpoint pins were re-stamped for the changed setup action; and the report docs/reports/COMPILED-ROOT-ACTIVATION-v1.00.30.md carries the repair note at implementation head f706e2c3799d3c2c37a3b2fcfaef041712274715 with content digest c7c51c6a68ae9dc378b4d7f9586156ab6650c636ea54d4556cad78e77543de53."))